title Image Upload & Gallery

component image-gallery-webapp as "Image Gallery" web-application
component image-api as "Image API" service
component image-db as "Image Metadata DB" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south aws-s3 as "Amazon S3" service

north -> image-gallery-webapp

image-gallery-webapp -> image-api
image-gallery-webapp -> user-auth

image-api -> user-auth
image-api -> image-db
image-api -> aws-s3
